<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-14T23:15:46.627Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:15:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified cross-border attacks, launching missile and drone strikes on Saudi Arabia targeting a weapons depot and troop gatherings near the border, while Saudi defenses intercepted drones heading for Riyadh. In Yemen, Houthi shelling in Taiz killed a child and wounded six civilians, and ballistic missiles were fired at Aden, prompting warnings of civilian risk. Saudi-led forces have conducted air strikes across Yemen, including a claimed 72 strikes in 24 hours, and have struck Sanaa. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPcXIwbkFRM3dlZktvS0VBdHVLQURXY28xdmxYVnNnUUk3Sy1RRmd0dTNBeFhWS29TVVM1RVh3aGd5cmpObC1naWw4a25qTXRPOTRndFY0REw5UlY4d2tlR1dzMFNhbmlXc0NHSXMwWVpZcFZhOE1vQllfT3ZWZXU1X00wLWhiRnNPdmdnQnI4SUJrb0Q5eHRPRmlKYzg1akt0U0ZnM29LejY?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOaGlVMHRBR1BUU0kzMlhCN28xUmNWNlJCQmNGdkxhbkkxYmpRRERGV05wekNkY3N6dUp1MlJDRXF6ZHhQNU9Gbll5TEZiWlBaUE16VjVoSHdVWUVkSHhxaFFOVElla3JaRlJvZEIzQ1N4Z3dkM2Rqb2F1RlFyRy1sX1VsakNjbTFCQ1JVU0RmZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breakingthenews.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPd3RJUm9iTXVmd3NfRFYtSXlzVEhRWHNNcUgwVGFxUVFJb1VSYl9ia0x4NDVPMVNWbllXWHFtUTFLeWNRX09XNDZsMVZMaUlKNWlxb1lscmlnalR6aDlka05UbzRxMFdnNXJiTG5FU2xTTzBqLTJQWTBtTVdNMUdhektZOTI1LVJWRVFzRHJOcVd1Z1g4OUVpSWlsWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFB4WEQwdHhkYmFxMHFLY1UxZ0hMVmRyZGpNSmk4MlRvdmdmeVZOTUtHRmpObDl2aHFtY2VDaWlCYXFvUmRqLXRUdDNNanRwZ3pUbEUyZG1HT3NHV1JCX2FLbkd3UGhjMDZ0VGQ4XzgtSjJ0UGxVUWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;يمن مونيتور&lt;/